          "genderAsCurated": "Male",
          "ambiguousAsCurated": true,
          "disambiguationNote": "Nehemiah (The son of Hachaliah ( Nehemiah 1:1 ), and probably of the tribe of Judah. His family must have belonged to Jerusalem ( Nehemiah 2:3 ). He was one of the \"Jews of the dispersion,\" and in his youth was appointed to the important office of royal cup-bearer at the palace of Shushan)",
